This product includes software developed at Primaris Research Group (https://github.com/Primaris-Research-Group/procurator).

Third-party components:

* OpenClaw gateway — MIT License. PROCURATOR runs as plugins on the OpenClaw gateway and ships the upstream
  Docker Compose file, pinned to one image version (licenses/OpenClaw-MIT.txt, licenses/openclaw-compose-provenance.json).
* playwright-core (Microsoft) — Apache License 2.0. Installed at setup time for the browser driver; not bundled.
* Browserbase CLI — installed at setup time by the owner when the cloud browser lane is enabled; not bundled.

Runtime dependencies of PROCURATOR's own code: the Python standard library and Node.js, nothing else.
